Designed and implemented a serverless ETL pipeline using AWS services to automatically process data uploaded to Amazon S3.
Configured AWS Lambda to trigger the workflow on CSV file upload events.
Developed an AWS Glue ETL job to transform and process CSV data (CSV → structured/processed output).
Integrated Amazon EventBridge to track pipeline execution events and automate workflow orchestration.
Implemented Amazon SNS to send real-time email notifications on successful job completion or failure.
Enabled Amazon CloudWatch for monitoring, logging, and troubleshooting of Lambda and Glue jobs.
Built a fully event-driven, automated data pipeline with minimal manual intervention.
